A flyer like this is a shareable, self-contained visual - perfect as a single HTML artifact. I'll build it as one printable/shareable page with clean inline styling.

Here's your flyer, ready to view and print:

<artifact identifier="plant-swap-flyer" type="text/html" title="Plant Swap Flyer - Willow Lane Community Garden">
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Plant Swap Flyer</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Caveat:wght@700&display=swap');

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  body {
    background: #e9e4d8;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .flyer {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 700px;
    background: #fdfbf5;
    border: 10px solid #4a7c3a;
    border-radius: 18px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    padding: 40px 44px 36px;
  }

  .leaf-corner {
    position: absolute;
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    opacity: 0.18;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .leaf-tl { top: -40px; left: -40px; transform: rotate(10deg); }
  .leaf-br { bottom: -40px; right: -40px; transform: rotate(190deg); }

  .eyebrow {
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #7a9c3f;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  h1 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 54px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #2f4b22;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  h1 span {
    color: #c7883a;
  }

  .subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 30px;
    color: #4a7c3a;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 18px 0;
  }
  .divider .line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 2px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, #a9c084 0, #a9c084 8px, transparent 8px, transparent 14px);
  }
  .divider .dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #c7883a;
  }

  .details {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 36px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 20px 0 24px;
  }

  .detail-card {
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 150px;
  }

  .detail-card .icon {
    font-size: 34px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    display: block;
  }

  .detail-card .label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8a7a;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .detail-card .value {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2f4b22;
  }

  .blurb {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    color: #3f3f33;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
  }

  .bring-box {
    background: #eef3e2;
    border: 2px dashed #8fae5c;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .bring-box h3 {
    color: #4a7c3a;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bring-list {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 28px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #3f3f33;
  }

  .bring-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .footer .rain {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #8a8a7a;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .footer .everyone {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #c7883a;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 10px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
    .flyer { box-shadow: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="flyer">
    <svg class="leaf-corner leaf-tl" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="#4a7c3a">
      <path d="M10,90 C10,50 50,10 90,10 C90,50 50,90 10,90 Z"/>
    </svg>
    <svg class="leaf-corner leaf-br" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="#4a7c3a">
      <path d="M10,90 C10,50 50,10 90,10 C90,50 50,90 10,90 Z"/>
    </svg>

    <div class="eyebrow">Neighbors &middot; Roots &middot; Community</div>
    <h1>Plant <span>Swap</span></h1>
    <div class="subtitle">bring a cutting, leave with something new &#127807;</div>

    <div class="divider"><div class="line"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="line"></div></div>

    <div class="details">
      <div class="detail-card">
        <span class="icon">&#128197;</span>
        <div class="label">Date</div>
        <div class="value">Saturday</div>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-card">
        <span class="icon">&#9200;</span>
        <div class="label">Time</div>
        <div class="value">9 &ndash; 11 AM</div>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-card">
        <span class="icon">&#128205;</span>
        <div class="label">Location</div>
        <div class="value">Willow Lane<br>Community Garden</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="blurb">
      Clear out your extra seedlings, cuttings, bulbs, and pots &mdash; and find new green
      friends for your own windowsill or backyard. All skill levels welcome, from
      black-thumb beginners to seasoned growers.
    </p>

    <div class="bring-box">
      <h3>What to Bring</h3>
      <ul class="bring-list">
        <li>&#127793; Plants or cuttings</li>
        <li>&#129716; Spare pots</li>
        <li>&#127991;&#65039; Labels (if you know the name!)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div class="rain">No plants to swap? Come anyway &mdash; extras will be shared freely.</div>
      <span class="everyone">Free &middot; Open to All</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
</artifact>

The flyer's ready to preview - open the artifact's Share option if you'd like a public link to send out. A few things you may want to tweak:

- I left the plant swap's actual **date** as "Saturday" since no specific calendar date was given - happy to add one.
- Contact info (phone/email/organizer name) and a rain-date/backup plan aren't included yet.

